easureSequence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSequence}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S\\)</span> (normal-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b22660cd0ce1252a\" href=\"?note=b22660cd0ce1252a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal\">58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MeasureSequence}_S(\\vec U,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\lambda,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(\\vec U(\\alpha),\\kappa)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{MeasureSequence}_S(\\vec U,\\kappa,\\lambda)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec U,\\lambda,\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)))\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in\\lambda\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcNormalMeasureOnCardinal}_S(\\vec U(\\alpha),\\kappa)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>每个正规测度都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> 的子集，所以序列有显式集合值域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"b22660cd0ce1252a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-lc-normal-measure-on-cardinal",